&_nc_oc=AdrwqwyLmU1-1cLOUvRUGe1vl2FEWF4L7g9l3exGvXLT9f2Ku_AuiVYVjfhs6GFzbks&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxyBjb1EWOI6j2nLFB6HV0W-NNNf1X-wtSHkI57GVKsnw&oe=69C2727E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=52RhuplAkpAQ7kNvwH8mla6&_nc_oc=AdqzfcAbSHiDuQZEJGMWPyyZ6cOSRiausU5EwVn1aOBOFVvU4CZE9mhTi9OVhwD_H7E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxNgiligr751KnMFRmoiQz8IuYXT2An-AD6G7NMrS8XMA&oe=69C2837C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UHJgfIJCnUYQ7kNvwFbJMn3&_nc_oc=AdpoAilqrdVYFYa1o8265NHClgBh6HWMjIQdpRhR6LtbAWystMtK46UiY0Db3Xk5fuI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzQrjPxqajJx-_dj4ROxsQFQtcPjBwnBjnJAGg1OZo1bQ&oe=69C2A207"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VwxGFcLFOr4Q7kNvwFOv2sy&_nc_oc=AdoFjtwcL-ya0yfR8ovHjBbpkxcYxfdU4UdxJX2RRqJmCVuNyKQGxVY-GCOeSRTVVz4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwBafDjtowm4Q9BB119NKlh2e1i9dN7nbCJsKz_sQN-jQ&oe=69C28DD5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xle5DtTbwa8Q7kNvwFJ14vd&_nc_oc=Adpq9KyYMDLnnXSgEkSJcVpC4KX7Wax1b7-kCSbyc8PUVyos6TeDv__2kThfpLEtSKY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afy43sZ7d7_QWKeZl7iAF31l4hHrv5Ki7p3R8l0Eg25mTg&oe=69C29A64"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.